  m_functionName: 
  m_description: 'Composes the final shaded color by combining baked lighting, toon
    ramp shading, sphere map effects, specular highlights, additional lights, and
    HDR scaling.

    Integrates all lighting contributions into a single final color
    output suitable for stylized and MMD-inspired rendering pipelines.'
